  "details": "The loading screen stopped scaling the view to make it as if you're in the environment, and now always makes it more like a skydome or skybox however you call it. I have the island one, and it used to start off as a skydome and then adjust the view in a way that made it as if my avatar was on the island like it was its own vrc world, but now it stays as a 3D skybox and makes it slightly disorienting. \n\nThe custom loading screen also makes the second loading screen after the world downloaded where it says initiallizing, just a black environment. No skybox, just darkness and the initiallizing text with the world icon above it.",
